# The never-store mirror (IR-13): the atlas's charter/never-store.yaml paths, as the house's copy
# catalog/never-store.json carries them, so nothing on the list can be staged. Kept equal to that copy by
# house/guards.py and the tree guard (tools/intake.py tree); change both in one commit.
# never-store mirror: begin
**/SubstrateSoulData/**
**/RECALL*.md
**/recall_spec*
**/*.enc
**/.prev/**
**/SubstrateSoul.prev/**
**/transcripts/**
**/*.transcript.*
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# never-store mirror: end
